Bundled Orchestrator default templates
--------------------------------------
toolkit/references/default-templates/ (copied into the skill folder and dist/)
holds the default preconfiguration templates that HPE Aruba EdgeConnect
Orchestrator returns from GET /gms/appliance/preconfiguration/default, one
file per Orchestrator release, exported from the authors' own lab. They are
included unmodified so the toolkit can work offline; the example values in
them (addresses, serial numbers, contacts) are Orchestrator's own examples.

